In the passage, the word ''rhythm'' most nearly means:', '["music", "speed", "regular pattern", "sound"]', 2, 'Planting followed the regular yearly pattern of the flood.', '{"0": "Rhythm has a musical sense, but here it is the timing of the flood.", "1": "The flood''s speed is not the point.", "3": "No sound is described."}'),
  ('NEN-0005', 'Reading and figurative language', 'Author''s purpose', 'hard', 'Markhor Prep original question', 'Read the passage and answer the question.
