How is the passage organised?', '["As a comparison of two modern bicycles", "In the order in which the bicycle developed", "As a list of famous riders", "As an argument against cycling"]', 1, 'It goes from no pedals, to front-wheel pedals, to high-wheelers, to the chain-driven safety bicycle.', '{"0": "Only historical designs are discussed.", "2": "No riders are named.", "3": "Nothing argues against cycling."}'),
  ('NEN-0015', 'Reading and figurative language', 'Meaning from context', 'moderate', 'Markhor Prep original question', 'Read the passage and answer the question.
