The word ''Remarkably'' in the passage shows that the author finds the bees'' behaviour:', '["dangerous", "ordinary", "difficult to believe", "surprising and impressive"]', 3, '''Remarkably'' signals admiration and surprise.', '{"0": "Nothing suggests danger.", "1": "The author stresses how rare it is.", "2": "The author accepts it as fact."}')
